  "body": "Issue:\r\n1. uv__io_poll calls uv__udp_io with revents == POLLIN + POLLOUT\r\n2. uv__udp_io calls your recv_cb\r\n3. you close the handle in callback\r\n4. uv__udp_io calls uv__udp_sendmsg\r\n5. uv__udp_sendmsg calls uv__io_feed\r\n6. kaboom!",
